  "family": "fiction",
  "category": "fantasy and science fiction",
  "premise": "A toy astronaut wants to hang a welcome sign, but in the fantasy station every visitor arrives from a different wall. They replace the one-direction sign with a slowly rotating ring of repeated WELCOME text, then add matching floor symbols so each arrival can orient to a chosen route.",
  "hook": "Which way is the welcome upside down?",
